<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="PulseSpace is a social space for ideas, people and conversations that matter.">
    <title>About PulseSpace</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="public-page">
    <main class="about-shell">
        <nav class="public-nav" aria-label="Public navigation">
            <a class="brand" href="/">
                <span class="brand-mark">P</span>
                <span>PulseSpace</span>
            </a>
            <div class="public-nav-links">
                <a href="#why-pulsespace">Why PulseSpace</a>
                <a href="#communities">Communities</a>
                <a class="button button-secondary" href="/login">Sign in</a>
                <a class="button button-primary" href="/signup">Create account</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">A SOCIAL SPACE FOR CURIOUS MINDS</p>
                <h1>Find your people.<br><span>Share what matters.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-description">PulseSpace brings thoughtful conversations, fresh perspectives and the people who inspire you into one welcoming feed.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="/signup">Join PulseSpace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                    <a class="text-link" href="#why-pulsespace">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="member-note"><span class="member-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Made for meaningful connection, not endless noise.</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Preview of the PulseSpace community feed">
                <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
                <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
                <div class="floating-card card-top"><span class="mini-avatar avatar-orange">MR</span><span><strong>Mia shared an idea</strong><small>2 min ago</small></span><b>•••</b></div>
                <div class="feed-preview">
                    <div class="preview-header"><span class="brand-mark">P</span><span>Today in your space</span><span class="preview-dot"></span></div>
                    <div class="preview-title">Small ideas can start<br>big conversations.</div>
                    <div class="preview-line"></div>
                    <div class="preview-line short"></div>
                    <div class="preview-footer"><span>♡ 248</span><span>◌ 36 replies</span><span>↗ Share</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card card-bottom"><span class="mini-avatar avatar-purple">JC</span><span><strong>James joined AI Revolution</strong><small>12 new members</small></span><span class="plus-badge">+</span></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-features" id="why-pulsespace">
            <div class="feature-heading">
                <p class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOU</p>
                <h2>A better way to<br>stay connected.</h2>
            </div>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">✦</span>
                <h3>Conversations that matter</h3>
                <p>Share your perspective and discover ideas beyond the algorithm.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">◎</span>
                <h3>Find your community</h3>
                <p>Meet people who care about the topics that light you up.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">↗</span>
                <h3>Your space, your voice</h3>
                <p>Create, connect and shape a feed that feels genuinely yours.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <footer class="public-footer" id="communities">
            <span>PulseSpace · Connect through ideas.</span>
            <span>Ready when you are. <a href="/signup">Create your account →</a></span>
        </footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
